window.EXAUD={"Please accept this small gift from our class.": "audio/cau/86e7a0b4e2454140.mp3", "Lan accepted the invitation, but Minh refused it.": "audio/cau/ac6f7b1f73f4208f.mp3", "Students have access to the library.": "audio/cau/96291a95352cbb8d.mp3", "I can access the Internet at home.": "audio/cau/79f14e4aa5fdf467.mp3", "Her hard work is admirable.": "audio/cau/aeb92522c5cebff3.mp3", "Helping old people is admirable.": "audio/cau/cd61114e479aeee9.mp3", "I have great admiration for my teacher.": "audio/cau/fa35570f870c8d17.mp3", "They looked at the painting with admiration.": "audio/cau/576a3d4d021b4944.mp3", "I admire my grandfather for his hard work.": "audio/cau/43f4c43f666a1b38.mp3", "Nam admires his teacher because she is an admirable person.": "audio/cau/a832e698437d0dac.mp3", "He is a great admirer of Ho Chi Minh.": "audio/cau/7786ab4e0273838c.mp3", "The singer has many admirers.": "audio/cau/85f112286800f976.mp3", "We agreed to meet at the school gate at seven.": "audio/cau/c695632c2d4e4f6d.mp3", "Lan agreed with her mum's plan.": "audio/cau/b10bae02e40e5ba8.mp3", "We reached an agreement after the talk.": "audio/cau/1544b408c62fc15c.mp3", "She nodded in agreement.": "audio/cau/4c9349a25fbbf77c.mp3", "My parents allow me to play games at weekends.": "audio/cau/0e78db317452b06e.mp3", "The park doesn't allow bikes; it bans them.": "audio/cau/cf368ad5bb4a58ec.mp3", "My parents give me a weekly allowance.": "audio/cau/6f99a39b2452a943.mp3", "I save part of my allowance.": "audio/cau/ea79159a664a92e3.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Our school has an annual sports day.": "audio/cau/79a5ad0d85af7703.mp3", "The festival is held annually; it's an annual event.": "audio/cau/36569856096efe21.mp3", "The festival is held annually.": "audio/cau/1007cf284a42819f.mp3", "We visit our grandparents annually.": "audio/cau/bc9a20ff12e3f207.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Mai answered all the questions in the quiz.": "audio/cau/c93d065e33503510.mp3", "Khoa answered \"Yes\" to question 3.": "audio/cau/0f875ac2987d5d20.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "The baby is asleep in her room.": "audio/cau/0fcf9f481653136f.mp3", "Nam fell asleep at ten and slept for eight hours.": "audio/cau/9a3306cb5d5d72e2.mp3", "I attend Le Loi Secondary School.": "audio/cau/2106fb1a21b48167.mp3", "Many people attended the festival.": "audio/cau/d86fc7a983ad38ca.mp3", "Please pay attention to the teacher.": "audio/cau/9cbf379be0e4f13b.mp3", "Lan is an attentive student who pays attention in class.": "audio/cau/991bd7e8b14790af.mp3", "Be attentive in class.": "audio/cau/4c32da426c39662a.mp3", "She is an attentive listener.": "audio/cau/59ab0971a228f869.mp3", "You should sleep eight hours a night if you want to be awake and fully alert.": "audio/cau/45c0c4c3aa5602c1.mp3", "Are you still awake? It's midnight.": "audio/cau/fe9ef9cda8f30799.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "The school bans phones in class.": "audio/cau/b0af45ee2d92cbd2.mp3", "Smoking is banned here.": "audio/cau/123fbc274f4b91a5.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a World Heritage Site.": "audio/cau/5a085a89254963b8.mp3", "There are thousands of islands in the bay.": "audio/cau/4cf873f6cc8fd985.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Hoi An is a beautiful old town.": "audio/cau/e98bb193dd75aa2b.mp3", "Lan sings beautifully, and her voice is beautiful.": "audio/cau/4d5c5951771c97b1.mp3", "She sings beautifully.": "audio/cau/d5196d517491e1f4.mp3", "The room is beautifully decorated.": "audio/cau/379b1e778bdefbb9.mp3", "We love the beauty of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b293e5559d039844.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is famous for its beauty; it is really beautiful.": "audio/cau/59dc842a0cb367f8.mp3", "Sleep is a biological need.": "audio/cau/6dbccaf76b406ec0.mp3", "They study biological changes in plants.": "audio/cau/a71e7050a6cbe48d.mp3", "My grandpa goes to the market by boat.": "audio/cau/144e963c57b5e9ec.mp3", "There are many boats on the Mekong River.": "audio/cau/b99180aa114c4718.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "Son Doong is the biggest cave in the world.": "audio/cau/47015280ee85734a.mp3", "We explored a dark cave in Quảng Bình.": "audio/cau/4fd3beb6a1d030e0.mp3", "The village has a communal house.": "audio/cau/f7a599856d520234.mp3", "We share a communal kitchen.": "audio/cau/bf8136bb48726928.mp3", "Our community has a new library.": "audio/cau/7685676fa4ede1ca.mp3", "People in my community help each other.": "audio/cau/3abacee40ff72839.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Connect the laptop to the Internet.": "audio/cau/083f71db481310ee.mp3", "The bridge connects two villages.": "audio/cau/b1569f595ecaee4e.mp3", "A young couple lives next door.": "audio/cau/d0f20b42a6aca611.mp3", "Wait a couple of minutes.": "audio/cau/88b6985e0d22ec59.mp3", "The ground is covered with leaves.": "audio/cau/9be377cd46f8db97.mp3", "She covered the cake with a cloth.": "audio/cau/f4d0b43accf9beb5.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "The plant is dead because I forgot to water it.": "audio/cau/bd6933cd22810bf6.mp3", "My phone battery is dead.": "audio/cau/cb93d3711c2b9485.mp3", "Can you define the word 'happy'?": "audio/cau/efc5d31f8e8029e0.mp3", "A dictionary defines words.": "audio/cau/5437b90d6d4f33e4.mp3", "Match each word with its definition.": "audio/cau/ce1a413bb9b18090.mp3", "Can you define this word? Read its definition first.": "audio/cau/0a03b83109a0e126.mp3", "Read the definitions and find the words.": "audio/cau/e1aa84a2fed6f514.mp3", "The dictionary defines 'craft' and gives two definitions.": "audio/cau/37e4701dbc025d6c.mp3", "The fire destroyed the old house.": "audio/cau/36cb28d95071f932.mp3", "Pollution destroys the environment.": "audio/cau/b351f0817a25406e.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Customs differ from country to country.": "audio/cau/867f1b35e7b382a9.mp3", "The twins differ in character.": "audio/cau/6fe7387847575daa.mp3", "What is the difference between these pictures?": "audio/cau/6c98c14e1c41bd67.mp3", "Small actions can make a big difference.": "audio/cau/2df232067e45e4a5.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "People think differently.": "audio/cau/f177b3ef34202d8f.mp3", "The word is spelled differently in American English.": "audio/cau/f1593ad480f9bd47.mp3", "I disagree with your idea.": "audio/cau/7cce19c50dd76b38.mp3", "Nam agrees, but Lan disagrees with him.": "audio/cau/c54e8ccfbafa7323.mp3", "Scientists discovered a new cave.": "audio/cau/bac4c5cbd52edfc5.mp3", "Let's discover the old town.": "audio/cau/2e32ccab0ea1644f.mp3", "It was an important discovery.": "audio/cau/23f9b4c1af7c300b.mp3", "The discovery of fire changed human life.": "audio/cau/d273e705a86eca5f.mp3", "Việt Nam has great cultural diversity.": "audio/cau/ee82144163746577.mp3", "The forest has a diversity of plants.": "audio/cau/ea414ea6c9aa1291.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "I have a small dog.": "audio/cau/d418efa45ea78edf.mp3", "Our dog plays with our neighbour's puppy.": "audio/cau/fe69c388bd55c243.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "I feel drowsy after lunch.": "audio/cau/8b96843ac9490a48.mp3", "Don't drive when you are drowsy.": "audio/cau/efbc8af1819149b7.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "The Earth goes around the Sun.": "audio/cau/e9deae5a50bf8484.mp3", "We must protect the Earth.": "audio/cau/c5818b11faf951cb.mp3", "We eat rice every day.": "audio/cau/e1b9f1e0ff973ad1.mp3", "We eat rice today, but yesterday we ate pho.": "audio/cau/575ec69b6a817f1a.mp3", "They are eating lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/a078c9c78cfba095.mp3", "Mi is eating noodles now, but she ate rice yesterday.": "audio/cau/dc16d4445e8d0d89.mp3", "Parents encourage children to read books.": "audio/cau/e023715e37fdca1c.mp3", "My teacher's encouragement makes me want to try harder.": "audio/cau/0c43bb2e98cce98e.mp3", "Give your friends encouragement before a test.": "audio/cau/353f7ccbf193aeeb.mp3", "Thanks to her teacher's encouragement, Mai joined the contest.": "audio/cau/d478168aaa26d53d.mp3", "The school encourages students to cycle.": "audio/cau/55015a044cda79bc.mp3", "Mum always encourages me, and her encouragement helps a lot.": "audio/cau/1e0ecb02e6570d51.mp3", "Take off your shoes before entering the house.": "audio/cau/d6b549e5eb7a1ca9.mp3", "The students are entering the hall.": "audio/cau/b7baaca5f04297a3.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "Can you explain this word to me?": "audio/cau/24d0a040fda8d776.mp3", "Our teacher explains the rule and gives a clear explanation.": "audio/cau/cbec68cd02ed3746.mp3", "Thank you for your explanation.": "audio/cau/5f2fb1e50d13f4ae.mp3", "Mi explained the lesson, and her explanation was clear.": "audio/cau/0e9b4cd1ea67bf72.mp3", "Our teacher's explanations are clear and easy.": "audio/cau/13183cbf6f62f35b.mp3", "Mi explained the rule, and her explanation helped Nam.": "audio/cau/75dba100b563b826.mp3", "Space exploration is very expensive.": "audio/cau/1a312a46b02f131a.mp3", "The cave is open for exploration.": "audio/cau/6fcef3e8e9072c7d.mp3", "We want to explore Phong Nha Cave.": "audio/cau/fc23cce7fe3d2660.mp3", "Let's explore the old town.": "audio/cau/53f1bca0671786f2.mp3", "The test was extremely difficult.": "audio/cau/ccc534030337d3ca.mp3", "I'm extremely happy to see you.": "audio/cau/6c7b609f63941630.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "I felt tired after the long trip.": "audio/cau/f7ebab0720e82cce.mp3", "She felt happy with her test result.": "audio/cau/d7738f786bd1138a.mp3", "The Mid-Autumn Festival is for children.": "audio/cau/c8113e2f409de630.mp3", "We enjoyed the flower festival in Da Lat.": "audio/cau/0e9e2d63c2aeb704.mp3", "I can't find my pencil.": "audio/cau/8c42ffdede29d976.mp3", "Lan lost her key, but Nam found it.": "audio/cau/59b8a65c0d818025.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "My parents forbid me to play games late.": "audio/cau/72d610837a7a8a7c.mp3", "The rules forbid smoking here.": "audio/cau/0aaa8f0d2b90ad71.mp3", "Many animals live in the forest.": "audio/cau/de5591cef1bfa727.mp3", "We went camping in the forest.": "audio/cau/81f5245d16792b64.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "The government builds new schools.": "audio/cau/fd30f30543d3d5a2.mp3", "The government wants to protect forests.": "audio/cau/ec937b78410bcd00.mp3", "The guard stands at the school gate.": "audio/cau/0aee392cb562c33d.mp3", "Dogs can guard the house.": "audio/cau/c4afc71d13e13060.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "Traffic jams often happen at rush hour.": "audio/cau/8ca78ac3c5533334.mp3", "What happened to Nam yesterday?": "audio/cau/a0d18350a2c16ccf.mp3", "Look! What is happening outside?": "audio/cau/59242348e6abfc72.mp3", "Many things happen here, and something is happening now.": "audio/cau/6596b4e4a092c479.mp3", "Smoking does harm to your health.": "audio/cau/d90fd389ad2dca29.mp3", "Plastic bags can harm sea animals.": "audio/cau/ecea23c7d3aed1e8.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Don't hesitate to ask me for help.": "audio/cau/9310f0403d65bb86.mp3", "He hesitates before answering.": "audio/cau/816776abca728d23.mp3", "He said yes without hesitation.": "audio/cau/cb10122ba21df12e.mp3", "There was a short hesitation in her voice.": "audio/cau/c4da8fdaf1ce86f0.mp3", "There is a small hill behind my house.": "audio/cau/2785177006dd575d.mp3", "We climbed the hill to see the sunrise.": "audio/cau/39a9da03afb1946f.mp3", "Nam's family lives in a houseboat in Can Tho.": "audio/cau/e1a82abc441b31b1.mp3", "The houseboat is small but nice.": "audio/cau/d39a0215fb1af6aa.mp3", "This is an ideal place for a picnic.": "audio/cau/2de64d9bde2bbe2d.mp3", "Autumn is the ideal time to visit Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/08f6ef7fb312825c.mp3", "Call the doctor immediately!": "audio/cau/3af61681df60c831.mp3", "She answered immediately.": "audio/cau/d719228c3aee39c8.mp3", "Nobody is perfect; we are all imperfect.": "audio/cau/9fb5f3321e134fcf.mp3", "His English is imperfect but clear.": "audio/cau/bbbb929d2c8428b3.mp3", "It's impossible to finish this in an hour.": "audio/cau/8d72b521c4ddf0a6.mp3", "Nothing is impossible.": "audio/cau/58a713130982eaf9.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Phu Quoc is a beautiful island.": "audio/cau/f31657f8db0e6c06.mp3", "We took a boat to the island.": "audio/cau/9d8a709859849b19.mp3", "Minh finished his project just before the due date.": "audio/cau/6a8c8ece8bd3699e.mp3", "Hoa arrived just before the test started.": "audio/cau/ddc502e35be5489a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "The landscape in Ha Giang is amazing.": "audio/cau/0482f8706ad33e57.mp3", "He likes painting landscapes.": "audio/cau/c0f3081ea9bbe7de.mp3", "My grandpa makes a paper lantern for me.": "audio/cau/3ada4226c3e1c40e.mp3", "Hoi An has many colourful lanterns at night.": "audio/cau/390ae587beab81ac.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Fattening foods are likely to make you fat.": "audio/cau/48a449b0ab562079.mp3", "It is likely to rain this afternoon.": "audio/cau/8eefc31a147ddd80.mp3", "Which line comes after 'We're playing together'?": "audio/cau/ad977311b8dcbfd2.mp3", "Read the first line of the chant aloud.": "audio/cau/36ef301fe6cfba19.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "Can you locate Ha Noi on the map?": "audio/cau/49cd706381484546.mp3", "Use the map to locate the museum; its location is on Le Loi Street.": "audio/cau/333fc8bb8ddbb0be.mp3", "My school is located near the park.": "audio/cau/ba1aab8aab45e1d3.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is located in Quang Ninh.": "audio/cau/c34453878ec32757.mp3", "The hotel has a great location.": "audio/cau/13ac53cdc46ef0ef.mp3", "Can you show me the location on the map?": "audio/cau/28c479a12a6c49a6.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Nam looked at the old photos of his village.": "audio/cau/57a1a25de6c14b73.mp3", "She looked tired yesterday, but today she looks happy.": "audio/cau/72e5fb4099eea871.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "This shop has the lowest prices.": "audio/cau/f96fb375caf6f8c2.mp3", "January has the lowest temperature.": "audio/cau/b5daae8a7f5ba72e.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "Some English words have two meanings.": "audio/cau/c6e4715d74edc5b6.mp3", "One word can have many meanings, so check what it means here.": "audio/cau/6b80e6c4dbc628c3.mp3", "This is a good method to learn words.": "audio/cau/3c706623138a9ce2.mp3", "Our teacher uses a new method.": "audio/cau/63fd83da91e3b54f.mp3", "Mount Everest is the highest mountain.": "audio/cau/9d438a1d616fc420.mp3", "They climbed Mount Fuji last year.": "audio/cau/c36d5eee637ee0bf.mp3", "My shoes are covered in mud.": "audio/cau/b5c2cbc85f9f6566.mp3", "Buffaloes love lying in the mud.": "audio/cau/c23927ae9fbfcf52.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "She won a national prize in maths.": "audio/cau/6a93b9368e7abe3a.mp3", "Our nation has many national heroes.": "audio/cau/fe097f04f907a2a9.mp3", "What's your nationality? – I'm Vietnamese.": "audio/cau/b014a2963ce2a0a6.mp3", "Students of many nationalities study here.": "audio/cau/69961830c1359fbc.mp3", "The show is broadcast nationally.": "audio/cau/2cb4d46f15de799c.mp3", "She is known nationally as a singer.": "audio/cau/7730eae5a497ae0d.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a natural wonder.": "audio/cau/090f3246ac97d064.mp3", "We should use natural light.": "audio/cau/6a5bbb9647fc89e3.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "'Happiness' is a noun.": "audio/cau/13800fcab138059c.mp3", "A noun names a thing; 'teacher' is a noun.": "audio/cau/34772bd9ef9e3e2f.mp3", "Floods often occur in the rainy season.": "audio/cau/f8aefec57bda432c.mp3", "When did the accident occur?": "audio/cau/e1b4fef7ca096494.mp3", "The Pacific Ocean is the biggest ocean.": "audio/cau/3173e229089548be.mp3", "Plastic waste goes into the sea and then the ocean.": "audio/cau/7d40b32c72996455.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I visit my grandparents once a week.": "audio/cau/083f2aae5f70d702.mp3", "We go swimming once or twice a month.": "audio/cau/5ad39880465edceb.mp3", "There is only one bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/000e91b12face3a4.mp3", "Lan is an only child; she has just one cousin.": "audio/cau/b6ec9a93c21bdf30.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "The king lived in a big palace.": "audio/cau/04c1eeff7723b695.mp3", "We visited a palace in Hue.": "audio/cau/6bfc77817d623b87.mp3", "Phu Quoc is a paradise for tourists.": "audio/cau/9201f1535b3e9dab.mp3", "This bookshop is a paradise for readers.": "audio/cau/c88cbe59048e8ad9.mp3", "We often play in the park after school.": "audio/cau/8d37e1ca664dbf08.mp3", "Dad parks his motorbike near the park gate.": "audio/cau/54a831b26aaf5a2e.mp3", "Our city has many green parks.": "audio/cau/a168f9449cfe7ccd.mp3", "Lan's favourite park is near the lake.": "audio/cau/92519cdda7e295b8.mp3", "How much do you pay for a bowl of pho?": "audio/cau/e807ddb92a3f24db.mp3", "Mum paid for the books yesterday.": "audio/cau/15922b0414be0bc7.mp3", "You can make a payment by phone.": "audio/cau/364d4d9ceff8c0e1.mp3", "Cash payment is still popular.": "audio/cau/3becbcc878ec652a.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "She is the perfect friend for me.": "audio/cau/93a1a7b3e0cd0847.mp3", "Minh speaks English perfectly.": "audio/cau/8a49ccc3eb379195.mp3", "The cake was cooked to perfection.": "audio/cau/e36a9f4688249e51.mp3", "Nobody can reach perfection.": "audio/cau/3047e410c2183964.mp3", "She sang the song perfectly.": "audio/cau/ccdbdc716a5685b6.mp3", "I understand you perfectly.": "audio/cau/c454e3791192f5ea.mp3", "Phones are not permitted in class.": "audio/cau/42d9175751787d56.mp3", "My parents permit me to go out on Sunday.": "audio/cau/1cf0ddcc2b64df94.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "We looked at old photographs.": "audio/cau/669f0332f867cd84.mp3", "He took photographs of the trip.": "audio/cau/16ffe46c3b10d0b1.mp3", "Nam can make a pizza for the party.": "audio/cau/7f8db05244864c31.mp3", "Pizza is tasty, but you shouldn't eat it every day.": "audio/cau/9a8647d6f696ca9f.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "He possesses a large house.": "audio/cau/54bcdee1ea557095.mp3", "She possesses great skills.": "audio/cau/c409725ae9c78b75.mp3", "Vietnam possesses many beautiful beaches.": "audio/cau/65f5a0f77f9528a6.mp3", "He possesses a good memory.": "audio/cau/7cbf9b09b8acf493.mp3", "The 's in Mi's room shows possession.": "audio/cau/49b86fe5b7d202bc.mp3", "In \"Mi's twelve\", 's means is, not possession.": "audio/cau/e1dc95ca8f6e48b0.mp3", "We use the possessive case to show who owns something.": "audio/cau/31a8b5ffb7761ab4.mp3", "'Lan's' is the possessive form of 'Lan'.": "audio/cau/c731266135d2bafd.mp3", "\"Might\" shows possibility: you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/251964d638234f18.mp3", "There is a possibility of rain tomorrow.": "audio/cau/936641ceffab1fb0.mp3", "It's possible that you will have a sore throat.": "audio/cau/a29da13d9b1f80fa.mp3", "Come home as early as possible.": "audio/cau/c1e1885f92a2f738.mp3", "It will possibly rain tomorrow.": "audio/cau/50e4defffe5bbc44.mp3", "Could you possibly help me?": "audio/cau/302bf007ebba9c65.mp3", "The preservation of old houses is important.": "audio/cau/3ace5ba98b1721b1.mp3", "We support wildlife preservation.": "audio/cau/ba7ebbe40df6804b.mp3", "We must preserve our traditional crafts.": "audio/cau/4151c066363a5208.mp3", "The village works hard to protect and preserve its old houses.": "audio/cau/2efd6ae0e9834fdb.mp3", "Keep pressing the button.": "audio/cau/15be51e41bb730ab.mp3", "He is pressing the doorbell.": "audio/cau/498549462a1e352d.mp3", "She has a pretty face.": "audio/cau/b4057ea8bc4143dd.mp3", "The test was pretty easy.": "audio/cau/c3222808c2b9263e.mp3", "Look at the previous page.": "audio/cau/5236de3455b3c630.mp3", "I met her the previous day.": "audio/cau/209d74f5321dec53.mp3", "We should protect the environment.": "audio/cau/b90a58bb2e782cd1.mp3", "A helmet gives you protection on the road.": "audio/cau/20e1fdaea6d0589e.mp3", "Wear a hat for protection from the sun.": "audio/cau/12b42ac906e9da91.mp3", "Environmental protection is important.": "audio/cau/43e1448861a4441d.mp3", "Wear protective clothes in the lab.": "audio/cau/2bb33d7e58d7a7ee.mp3", "Parents are protective of their children.": "audio/cau/c55c927eb0326829.mp3", "I got a puppy for my birthday.": "audio/cau/0f9410e8f7c95b14.mp3", "The puppy is playing with a ball.": "audio/cau/9d756468bb5546bd.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "The Truong Son range is very long.": "audio/cau/f7e0a118892034eb.mp3", "The shop sells a wide range of books.": "audio/cau/2df9eb38401ecf81.mp3", "We can reach the city centre by bus.": "audio/cau/04ff8a28c2c1ea1e.mp3", "The bus line doesn't reach my village yet.": "audio/cau/7e34175d758a85c7.mp3", "There are many reasons to make new friends.": "audio/cau/b4aec367cd011148.mp3", "Write two reasons, and explain each reason.": "audio/cau/0e00874bd41b6407.mp3", "He refused to eat vegetables.": "audio/cau/10d640697636fc8d.mp3", "She refused my offer.": "audio/cau/13c75bed57f09b83.mp3", "Listen and repeat the words.": "audio/cau/a50278163c989459.mp3", "Please repeat it; repetition helps us remember.": "audio/cau/43cefd1dcd1c0767.mp3", "We ask for repetition when we can't hear someone.": "audio/cau/147624069647f8c5.mp3", "Repetition helps you remember new words.": "audio/cau/58b216cd92c4f23a.mp3", "We should respect old people.": "audio/cau/7f982b2a82038d84.mp3", "Show respect to your teachers.": "audio/cau/1ee30208ec2fb013.mp3", "The bell has rung.": "audio/cau/3168260b116cff35.mp3", "Has the phone rung yet?": "audio/cau/017d5640c4c06e57.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "We sang a song for our teacher.": "audio/cau/b15e54e6fae10b37.mp3", "She sang beautifully at the school concert.": "audio/cau/ed9eada273994992.mp3", "My grandparents' house is near the sea.": "audio/cau/acd2af1fe0d48aed.mp3", "We swim in the sea in summer.": "audio/cau/a658c72373cebc53.mp3", "She seems happy with her new school.": "audio/cau/3e31d1c56b24fe23.mp3", "It seems that it will rain soon.": "audio/cau/c9c966e55e6996ed.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "The rope is too slack.": "audio/cau/248ecebf435f9fd3.mp3", "Don't be slack about your homework.": "audio/cau/da0111ff97e08bb8.mp3", "Don't slap your little brother.": "audio/cau/0ebf0e579076e14f.mp3", "He slapped the table and laughed.": "audio/cau/11658cf19109dd66.mp3", "I sleep for eight hours every night.": "audio/cau/2d2df36764b2d3d8.mp3", "Nam went to bed late, so he feels sleepy now.": "audio/cau/f0fe4a120a290c36.mp3", "If you're sleepy, you shouldn't ride your bike.": "audio/cau/24b06618dda8e4ce.mp3", "Hoa felt sleepy because she went to bed late.": "audio/cau/6ce80e5117754f2f.mp3", "This shirt has long sleeves.": "audio/cau/d86f2dd31857b2e8.mp3", "He rolled up his sleeves to wash the dishes.": "audio/cau/9045b9710dfcecc8.mp3", "Can I have a slice of bread?": "audio/cau/a14a112213d77ddf.mp3", "She cut the cake into eight slices.": "audio/cau/40c1890ba44cbc0b.mp3", "Children love playing on the slide.": "audio/cau/0e4be0f162b69cdf.mp3", "Look at the next slide, please.": "audio/cau/8cb04e6182efeb63.mp3", "Be careful not to slip on the wet floor.": "audio/cau/70a79530ca3d2456.mp3", "Old people can easily slip in the bathroom.": "audio/cau/8b943b4e1ef84a27.mp3", "The road is slippery after the rain.": "audio/cau/9c46b77ed6622d4d.mp3", "Fish are slippery and hard to hold.": "audio/cau/2fc8fff30f7a4e5c.mp3", "Our class made a slogan about saving water.": "audio/cau/edfac9b18b64ebeb.mp3", "'Go green' is a popular slogan.": "audio/cau/e9177755bdd963ab.mp3", "We walked up a steep slope.": "audio/cau/973882ba916b1448.mp3", "Tea grows on the slopes of the hill.": "audio/cau/304937a4d70aabba.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "Please speak slowly so I can understand.": "audio/cau/68b132e808a46997.mp3", "The old man walked slowly to the bus stop.": "audio/cau/87e81f4cf164cdf1.mp3", "I eat a snack after school.": "audio/cau/22fc71372a51324a.mp3", "Fruit is a healthy snack.": "audio/cau/bc652af37aac4a59.mp3", "A snail moves very slowly.": "audio/cau/62cce81e3a8241d9.mp3", "We saw a snail in the garden.": "audio/cau/15bc1115b1bb1941.mp3", "The snake goes \"sss\".": "audio/cau/454b133f55dcd972.mp3", "There is a green snake in the garden.": "audio/cau/505dbd6a4ebdee69.mp3", "The stick snapped in two.": "audio/cau/c00627a513928f94.mp3", "I snapped a photo of the sunset.": "audio/cau/fa7a5bab5d5fad61.mp3", "I lost one sneaker at the gym.": "audio/cau/ed090a4e1d655f2f.mp3", "This sneaker is too small for me.": "audio/cau/81b44a4b267fd4ad.mp3", "I wear sneakers for PE lessons.": "audio/cau/f7858070b13a345e.mp3", "These sneakers are very comfortable.": "audio/cau/014a9172c2e75f61.mp3", "Dust makes me sneeze.": "audio/cau/a45a18956516b7e1.mp3", "Cover your mouth when you sneeze.": "audio/cau/934dfc9e949736c3.mp3", "He sneezed three times in class.": "audio/cau/37fddb8bb4d3ceb8.mp3", "She sneezed because of the cold weather.": "audio/cau/c654129e92589c19.mp3", "Snip the paper along the line.": "audio/cau/412dbfe4dc18a191.mp3", "Mum snipped the tag off my new shirt.": "audio/cau/780483ee170ed98d.mp3", "I use a snorkel to look at fish.": "audio/cau/2da0d415a3c127d5.mp3", "Put on your mask and snorkel.": "audio/cau/63b1f40ca561c26e.mp3", "It doesn't snow in Ho Chi Minh City.": "audio/cau/5d100419b1876cc7.mp3", "Children love playing in the snow.": "audio/cau/370f0c7139ead303.mp3", "They threw snowballs at each other.": "audio/cau/58bded8028bc2457.mp3", "Let's make a big snowball.": "audio/cau/311bddb46382a205.mp3", "Snowstorms closed many roads.": "audio/cau/2cd44ebf10ad6ecc.mp3", "Snowstorms are common in Russia.": "audio/cau/d72d99225559da15.mp3", "It was a snowy day in Seoul.": "audio/cau/b2c5ef2dddadbdf9.mp3", "We saw snowy mountains from the plane.": "audio/cau/587cf049f4c48840.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Listen and repeat the sounds /b/ and /p/.": "audio/cau/82fd56c054a4daa9.mp3", "The /b/ sound in 'robe' is voiced.": "audio/cau/1a965cfa2b894959.mp3", "This is a good spot for a picnic.": "audio/cau/28c93ee0c5b412d2.mp3", "A ladybird has black spots.": "audio/cau/114961e94154c7be.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "This photo was taken in Hue.": "audio/cau/f504f1fe8bdf2bf6.mp3", "Have you taken your medicine?": "audio/cau/28798ff67a8368e9.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "The most important thing is to be honest.": "audio/cau/c302c847e8e66725.mp3", "Something is wrong; one thing is missing from my bag.": "audio/cau/c14d87bcc3d6fc9b.mp3", "I put my things in my schoolbag.": "audio/cau/bf35bafff88418e4.mp3", "There are many good things at my school, not just one thing.": "audio/cau/26ddc5ba45fd5524.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "I feel tired after a long day at school.": "audio/cau/38f8f044711c6b62.mp3", "The trip was tiring, so we were all tired.": "audio/cau/d54ee95b19e43d5d.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "Tourism is important to Da Nang.": "audio/cau/66c18d8036dc4cca.mp3", "Eco-tourism helps protect nature.": "audio/cau/e2cac58b1dc37552.mp3", "A tourist asked me the way to the lake.": "audio/cau/85504a3dd570c415.mp3", "Tourism is important, and every tourist loves our pho.": "audio/cau/28ec58cef47dd36f.mp3", "Many tourists visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/34e133dcd9a0fdd4.mp3", "The market attracts tourists and locals.": "audio/cau/4d4408900393fd12.mp3", "I visit my grandparents twice a month.": "audio/cau/f0929fd75b2d4afb.mp3", "Lan goes swimming twice a week, but Nam goes only once.": "audio/cau/7318ea16472cfb55.mp3", "The street looks ugly with all that rubbish.": "audio/cau/84027adc63b4f048.mp3", "The park was ugly before, but now it is beautiful.": "audio/cau/133c40c5a01388aa.mp3", "Underline the correct words in the sentences.": "audio/cau/4476062600b49f0c.mp3", "Mi underlined the new words with a red line.": "audio/cau/ee584f8e3d59f01b.mp3", "Read the underlined words aloud.": "audio/cau/6c18e837ccd3be90.mp3", "Please underline the verbs; Nam's underlined words are correct.": "audio/cau/bc51496fa725ab91.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "There is a sense of urgency in his voice.": "audio/cau/dc651c5b01713c6d.mp3", "We must act with urgency to save the forest.": "audio/cau/f03ead0ad87cf606.mp3", "Minh does the most urgent task first.": "audio/cau/7f0374a05c80b447.mp3", "Lan has an urgent project due tomorrow.": "audio/cau/8c232b5fd3a6bfb2.mp3", "The patient needs help urgently.": "audio/cau/6aa769498a52f6db.mp3", "We urgently need more volunteers.": "audio/cau/4fbef14e9c6bdbc0.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "The villagers are very friendly.": "audio/cau/83b65e1cf54c314b.mp3", "A villager showed us the way.": "audio/cau/8c99ee2c847588ae.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Phong visited his grandparents, and they enjoyed his visit.": "audio/cau/24f2a12ad9734414.mp3", "Each visitor gets a free map.": "audio/cau/d13c12d782a36fe7.mp3", "Many visitors visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/f97ffc3669fff0e8.mp3", "Bat Trang attracts many visitors.": "audio/cau/3b53ccd4a057d15e.mp3", "Visitors visit the craft village to buy pottery.": "audio/cau/364cd950cea318c5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "Workers wear helmets at work.": "audio/cau/58cc64267deb5ef1.mp3", "Mi usually wears jeans, but yesterday she wore a dress.": "audio/cau/23bb4a0107f750d1.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "Nam wore jeans yesterday, but today he is wearing trousers.": "audio/cau/f93860f5b315d691.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a natural wonder of Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/b6c81cae87b891ea.mp3", "I wonder what my new teacher is like.": "audio/cau/2d41b1bac533182b.mp3", "Lan wondered what to buy for her mum.": "audio/cau/db04a98b2b90c9cd.mp3", "I wonder how he did it, and my sister wondered too.": "audio/cau/f040716bd7ea03f5.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "There are twelve months in a year.": "audio/cau/5ae786ad7493bc72.mp3", "This year, Mi is in Grade 9.": "audio/cau/6bad90fc27f44b2c.mp3", "The school has a yearly sports day.": "audio/cau/750d62eaf703f585.mp3", "We have a yearly health check.": "audio/cau/4c5595be96ba759a.mp3", "My sister is twelve years old.": "audio/cau/28db75637c65c4ff.mp3", "He worked there for five years before he moved to Hue.": "audio/cau/eee3be2c2ba96ad1.mp3"};
